{"unit":103,"section":4,"cefr":"A2","objective":"understand Pu'al passive forms","skill":"Passive Pu'al","heading":"Pu'al passive","phrases":[{"he":"השיר הזה מדובר מאוד.","en":"This song is much talked about.","audio":"","tokens":[{"w":"השיר","h":["the song"]},{"w":"הזה","h":["this"]},{"w":"מדובר","h":["talked about","spoken of"]},{"w":"מאוד","h":["very","much"]}]},{"he":"האוכל בושל היטב.","en":"The food was cooked well.","audio":"","tokens":[{"w":"האוכל","h":["the food"]},{"w":"בושל","h":["was cooked"]},{"w":"היטב","h":["well"]}]},{"he":"הסיפור סופר לילדים.","en":"The story was told to the children.","audio":"","tokens":[{"w":"הסיפור","h":["the story"]},{"w":"סופר","h":["was told"]},{"w":"לילדים","h":["to the children"]}]},{"he":"הוא בוקש לעזור.","en":"He was asked to help.","audio":"","tokens":[{"w":"הוא","h":["he"]},{"w":"בוקש","h":["was asked","was requested"]},{"w":"לעזור","h":["to help"]}]}],"sentences":[{"he":"זה מדובר.","en":"It is spoken of.","alt":["It is talked about."],"t":"t"},{"he":"האוכל בושל.","en":"The food was cooked.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הסיפור סופר.","en":"The story was told.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"הוא בוקש לבוא.","en":"He was asked to come.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הבית נוקה היום.","en":"The house was cleaned today.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"המשחק שוחק אתמול.","en":"The game was played yesterday.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"מה דובר בישיבה?","en":"What was spoken about in the meeting?","alt":["What was discussed in the meeting?"],"t":"t"},{"he":"האורז בושל טוב.","en":"The rice was cooked well.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הסיפור סופר לכולם.","en":"The story was told to everyone.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"הנושא הזה מדובר הרבה.","en":"This topic is talked about a lot.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"החדר נוקה בבוקר.","en":"The room was cleaned in the morning.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הוא לא בוקש לעזור.","en":"He was not asked to help.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"האם הירקות בושלו?","en":"Were the vegetables cooked?","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הבדיחה סופרה שוב ושוב.","en":"The joke was told again and again.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"המשחק שוחק בפארק.","en":"The game was played in the park.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"הנושא דובר בכנסת.","en":"The topic was discussed in the Knesset.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"השטיח נוקה אתמול.","en":"The carpet was cleaned yesterday.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"מה בוקש ממך?","en":"What was asked of you?","alt":["What was requested from you?"],"t":"l"},{"he":"הבשר בושל לאט.","en":"The meat was cooked slowly.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הם בוקשו להישאר.","en":"They were asked to stay.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"האם הסיפור סופר נכון?","en":"Was the story told correctly?","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"הכדורגל שוחק ביום שישי.","en":"Football was played on Friday.","alt":["Soccer was played on Friday."],"t":"t"},{"he":"זה מדובר בכל העולם.","en":"It is talked about all over the world.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"המטבח נוקה אחרי ארוחת הערב.","en":"The kitchen was cleaned after dinner.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"הילדים בוקשו לשבת.","en":"The children were asked to sit.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הארוחה בושלה בזהירות.","en":"The meal was cooked carefully.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"העברית מדוברת בישראל.","en":"Hebrew is spoken in Israel.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"הוא סופר על הנסיעה שלו.","en":"He was told about his trip.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הספר הזה מדובר ברשת.","en":"This book is talked about online.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"היא בוקשה לדבר.","en":"She was asked to speak.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"הדג בושל במים רותחים.","en":"The fish was cooked in boiling water.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הסוד סופר לכל השכנים.","en":"The secret was told to all the neighbors.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"המגרש נוקה לפני המשחק.","en":"The field was cleaned before the game.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"התפקיד שוחק על ידי שחקן מפורסם.","en":"The role was played by a famous actor.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הנושאים האלה דוברו כבר.","en":"These topics were already discussed.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הם בוקשו להביא אוכל למסיבה.","en":"They were asked to bring food to the party.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"אנגלית מדוברת בכל מקום בעולם.","en":"English is spoken everywhere in the world.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"האם כבר נוקה פה?","en":"Was it already cleaned here?","alt":["Has it already been cleaned here?"],"t":"t"},{"he":"הכל סופר לי, אני יודע הכל.","en":"Everything was told to me, I know everything.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"הפסטה בושלה עם ירקות טריים.","en":"The pasta was cooked with fresh vegetables.","alt":[],"t":"t"}],"hints":{"זה":"it / this","מדובר":"talked about / spoken of","האוכל":"the food","בושל":"was cooked","הסיפור":"the story","סופר":"was told / was narrated","הוא":"he","בוקש":"was asked / was requested","לבוא":"to come","הבית":"the house","נוקה":"was cleaned","היום":"today","המשחק":"the game","שוחק":"was played","אתמול":"yesterday","מה":"what","דובר":"was spoken / was discussed","בישיבה":"in the meeting","האורז":"the rice","טוב":"good / well","לכולם":"to everyone","הנושא":"the topic / the subject","הזה":"this (masculine)","הרבה":"a lot / much","החדר":"the room","בבוקר":"in the morning","לא":"not / no","לעזור":"to help","האם":"is (question) / were","הירקות":"the vegetables","בושלו":"were cooked","הבדיחה":"the joke","סופרה":"was told (feminine)","שוב":"again","ושוב":"and again","בפארק":"in the park","בכנסת":"in the Knesset","השטיח":"the carpet","ממך":"from you / of you","הבשר":"the meat","לאט":"slowly","הם":"they","בוקשו":"were asked / were requested","להישאר":"to stay","נכון":"correctly / true","הכדורגל":"the football / the soccer","ביום":"on (day)","שישי":"Friday / sixth","בכל":"in all / everywhere","העולם":"the world","המטבח":"the kitchen","אחרי":"after","ארוחת":"meal of","הערב":"the evening / dinner","הילדים":"the children","לשבת":"to sit","הארוחה":"the meal","בושלה":"was cooked (feminine)","בזהירות":"carefully","העברית":"the Hebrew / Hebrew","מדוברת":"is spoken (feminine)","בישראל":"in Israel","סופר על":"was told about","על":"about / on","הנסיעה":"the trip","שלו":"his","הספר":"the book","ברשת":"online / on the net","היא":"she","בוקשה":"was asked (feminine)","לדבר":"to speak / to talk","הדג":"the fish","במים":"in water","רותחים":"boiling","הסוד":"the secret","לכל":"to all","השכנים":"the neighbors","המגרש":"the field / the court","לפני":"before","התפקיד":"the role","ידי":"by (hands of)","שחקן":"actor","מפורסם":"famous","הנושאים":"the topics / the subjects","האלה":"these","דוברו":"were discussed","כבר":"already","להביא":"to bring","אוכל":"food","למסיבה":"to the party","אנגלית":"English","מקום":"place","בעולם":"in the world","הכל":"everything","לי":"to me","אני":"I","יודע":"know","הפסטה":"the pasta","עם":"with","ירקות":"vegetables","טריים":"fresh","מאוד":"very / much","פה":"here","לילדים":"to the children","היטב":"well"},"words":[{"he":"דובר","en":"was spoken","alt":["was discussed"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"dubar"},{"he":"סופר","en":"was told","alt":["was narrated"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"supar"},{"he":"בושל","en":"was cooked","alt":[],"from":"lexicon","tr":"bushal"},{"he":"לומד","en":"was taught","alt":[],"from":"lexicon","tr":"lumad"},{"he":"בוקש","en":"was requested","alt":["was asked"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"bukash"},{"he":"שוחק","en":"was played","alt":[],"from":"lexicon","tr":"sukhak"},{"he":"נוקה","en":"was cleaned","alt":[],"from":"lexicon","tr":"nukah"},{"he":"מדובר","en":"spoken of","alt":["talked about"],"from":"skill","tr":"medubar"},{"he":"מדוברת","en":"is spoken (feminine)","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"meduberet"},{"he":"בושלה","en":"was cooked (feminine)","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"bushlah"},{"he":"סופרה","en":"was told (feminine)","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"suprah"},{"he":"בוקשה","en":"was asked (feminine)","alt":["was requested (feminine)"],"from":"skill","tr":"bukshah"},{"he":"בוקשו","en":"were asked","alt":["were requested"],"from":"skill","tr":"bukshu"},{"he":"בושלו","en":"were cooked","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"bushlu"},{"he":"דוברו","en":"were discussed","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"dubru"},{"he":"היטב","en":"well","alt":[],"from":"phrase","tr":"heitav"},{"he":"הסיפור","en":"the story","alt":[],"from":"phrase","tr":"hasipur"},{"he":"הסוד","en":"the secret","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"hasod"}],"lexemes":["דובר","דוברו","מדובר","מדוברת","סופר","סופרה","בושל","בושלה","בושלו","לומד","בוקש","בוקשה","בוקשו","שוחק","נוקה"],"tips":"## Pu'al - Passive of Pi'el\n\nThe **Pu'al** (פועל) is the passive counterpart of Pi'el. If Pi'el means \"to cook\" (בישל), Pu'al means \"was cooked\" (בושל).\n\n### Pattern recognition:\n- First vowel is **u** (קובוץ): **בּוּשַׁל**\n- Middle letter has no dagesh (unlike Pi'el)\n\n### Present tense (participle) - מְ prefix:\n| | Masculine | Feminine |\n|--|-----------|----------|\n| Singular | מְדוּבָּר | מְדוּבֶּרֶת |\n| Plural | מְדוּבָּרִים | מְדוּבָּרוֹת |\n\n### Past tense:\n| Person | Form |\n|--------|------|\n| הוא | דוּבַּר |\n| היא | דוּבְּרָה |\n| הם/הן | דוּבְּרוּ |\n\n### Common Pu'al verbs:\n| Pi'el (active) | Pu'al (passive) | Meaning |\n|---------------|-----------------|----------|\n| דיבר (spoke) | דובר (was spoken) | |\n| סיפר (told) | סופר (was told) | |\n| בישל (cooked) | בושל (was cooked) | |\n| ביקש (asked) | בוקש (was asked) | |\n| ניקה (cleaned) | נוקה (was cleaned) | |"}